{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/d5bba22255fe741b43acd9e617f195e4.avif?t=1755879756\" width=1061 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortiori is an endless number multiplication Deck Modifier  about scoring numbers larger than comprehension</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fortiori of Fortiori</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/234df4347b32b3b3576dc8e4e3438e0b.poster.avif?t=1755879756\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/234df4347b32b3b3576dc8e4e3438e0b.webm?t=1755879756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/234df4347b32b3b3576dc8e4e3438e0b.mp4?t=1755879756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the Score:</strong>\u00a0Multiply the cards in your hand to create a product that overcomes your own ever-growing score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the Number:\u00a0</strong>Tap cards to increase their value for bigger multiplications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the Risk:</strong> Every tap increases the chance that a card will get deleted.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split the Cost: </strong>Split a card in two if you ever accidentally lose one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Content of Fortiori</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/4d198a1c86ce2f5e32f2145c133e1b7a.poster.avif?t=1755879756\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/4d198a1c86ce2f5e32f2145c133e1b7a.webm?t=1755879756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/4d198a1c86ce2f5e32f2145c133e1b7a.mp4?t=1755879756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 Unique Buffs:</strong> Collect and Play around various unique buffs in fortiori.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 25 Damning Debuffs:</strong> Unavoidable effects that disrupt your plans and force constant adaptation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 Punishing Bosses:</strong> Face down unique bosses, losing to whom doesn't call for game over but rather makes the game much harder. Winning however changes the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ways of Fortiori\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/f8ec9253f151be11546490ff0fdc51f7.poster.avif?t=1755879756\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/f8ec9253f151be11546490ff0fdc51f7.webm?t=1755879756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/f8ec9253f151be11546490ff0fdc51f7.mp4?t=1755879756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> The way Fortiori is meant to be played, Defeat 7 bosses to win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss-less Mode:</strong> Normal mode but without bosses....for some people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Mode:</strong> No bosses, No debuffs, increased buffs count, this mode is just to relax.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fortiori Live Wallpaper Engine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/cc5f07d2b4fef6ea6c8aad903d1c9fd3.poster.avif?t=1755879756\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/cc5f07d2b4fef6ea6c8aad903d1c9fd3.webm?t=1755879756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926150/extras/cc5f07d2b4fef6ea6c8aad903d1c9fd3.mp4?t=1755879756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Modular Editor:</strong> Have control over every aspect of in-game effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Import Your Own Images:</strong> Personalize your creation by importing your favorite images directly into the editor. Supported formats include .PNG, .JPG, .BMP and .GIFS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock:</strong>\u00a0Import as many Clocks as you want and use the various in built options to customize there frames hands and numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Other Widgets:</strong> other widgets form the ones already written above include a text box, date display with various formats, a digital clock, transparent .png and gif support along with ability to set layers!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926150?t=1755879756","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam